    "summary": "Use it in your Command phase on 1 **LEGIONES DAEMONICA NURGLE** unit of yours on the battlefield. Apply the first of these that fits it:\n\n- A **MONSTER** unit: 1 of its models recovers as many as D3+1 lost wounds.\n- A **BATTLELINE** unit: as many as D3 **destroyed** models (not **CHARACTER** models) rejoin it with full wounds.\n- Any other unit: 1 destroyed model (not a **CHARACTER** model) may rejoin it with full wounds.",
